    "title": "School bus involved in crash on I-480 West - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Emily Smith ,\n1 days ago CLEVELAND (WJW) — Traffic along the Valley View Bridge on I-480 West was affected during the morning commute Tuesday morning after a crash involving a school bus. According to ODOT, the right lane of I-480 West was blocked beyond Transportation Blvd/E 98th St. due to the crash which was first reported around 8 a.m. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
